<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2383" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἴλῐνος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cry of anguish, dirge</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἴλινον αἴλινον εἰπέ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					121
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				627
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				1395
			</span></i>; of an <i>epitaph,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				6.348
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Diod.
			</span></i>); said to be from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἶ Αίνον</span>
			<i>ah me for Linos!</i> cf. <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				9.29.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			Adj., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἴλινος, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span></span>, <i>mournful,
			plaintive</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰλίνοις κακοῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hel.</u>
					171
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρέφος αἴ.</span>”
				<i>unhappy,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					IG
					14.1502
				</span></i>
			: neut. pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἴλινα</span> as
				Adv., <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Ap.</u>
				20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Mosch.
				3.1
			</span></i>: hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰλινέω</span></b> 
			<i>sing a dirge</i>, cj. in <i><span class="en">
				Dosiad.
				<u>Ara</u>
				15
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
